                    buf.readerIndex(), buf.readableBytes() - 4 - 2, StandardCharsets.US_ASCII));
            if (!parser.matches()) {
                return null;
            }

            position.set(Position.PREFIX_TEMP + 1, parser.nextDouble(0));
            position.set(Position.KEY_FUEL_LEVEL, parser.nextDouble(0));

            return position;

